===Etymology===
{{inh+|fr|frm|mesnage}}, from {{inh|fr|fro|manage}}, {{m|fro|mainage}}, from {{m|fro|manoir}}, {{m|fro|maneir}}, {{m|fro|maindre}}, from {{der|fr|la|maneo|manēre}}. The {{cog|fro|-}} forms {{m|fro|maisnage}}, {{m|fro|mesnage}} were influenced by the word {{m|fro|maisnée}}, {{m|fro|maisnede}}, from {{der|fr|VL.|*mā(n)siōnāta}} ({{cog|fr|maisonnée}}), from {{der|fr|la|mānsiō}} (which also became {{cog|fr|maison}}).

